# t01-test-control-mutations.out

变异式对照：每一行都是一次「关掉该判定后用例必须红」的实测。
阴性臂（未变异）先跑，证明基线是绿的：
  exit=0  PASS: bin/control.sh usage, dispatch, status wiring, and no-port-literal

--- 变异：usage 里删掉 status 行
    exit=1
    FAIL: usage line missing:   status   Report whether those processes are alive and answering their health endpoint.

--- 变异：status 分派被短路（不再指向 harness）
    exit=1
    FAIL: no cloud status line

--- 变异：未知名词退出码 2 → 0
    exit=1
    FAIL: unknown verb exit=0, want 2

--- 变异：control.sh 里写进端口字面量
    exit=1
    FAIL: bin/control.sh carries a port literal; it belongs to the harness config

--- 变异：HARNESS 路径写错
    exit=1
    FAIL: status exit=127, want 0 or 1

还原后复跑（证明变异被撤销、基线回到绿）：
  exit=0  PASS: bin/control.sh usage, dispatch, status wiring, and no-port-literal
